eventh Transformers movie not only is  Davison a regular guest in various  tabloids but meanwhile he is also an  actor frankly he never played Major  roles and he probably won't ever win an  Academy Award either yet his Fame is  beyond dispute especially since he is a  full-time comedian and thus should not  have any trouble with dubbing Davison  voices the role of Autobot Mirage Alias  Dino who can transform into a red  Ferrari 458 and who some may know from  Transformers 3 Michelle  meanwhile dubs the part of the quiet and  self-assured maximal erazor Stephen  cable Jr is in charge of directing the  film and we cannot wait to see the final  outcome the movie is planned for release  on June 9 2023.  Black Adam will finally be released in  cinemas in a few days time after many  years of production particularly due to  the involvement of Dwayne Johnson many  can barely wait to finally seed the Grim  and well-built main character in action  in recent days a conversation between  Johnson and journalist Jake Hamilton  caused quite a stir where the 50 year  old continued to raise Spirits for the  film The two talk about what an  encounter between Black Adam and  Superman would probably look like and  that Black Adam would likely strike the  first blow but definitely not the last  one speaking to Cinema Blend Johnson  also made the point of saying that the  two would definitely clash in an  upcoming film in the dceu he added that  this was also to meet the expectations  of the fans who have been hoping for  such a spectacle for quite some time we  wonder whether we will see The Return of  Henry Cavill after all this has been one  of the biggest fan requests for the cast  of Superman it remains exciting at  present many premieres of Black Adam are  running and the U.S theatrical release  on October 21st is also near as soon as  the hype around Black Adam has died down  we hope to have news about a film  featuring both DC characters  for all MCU fans there was a bit of a  downer this week as Disney surprisingly  announced a number of long-awaited  Marvel movies have been postponed in  some cases quite significantly a proper  reason was not given however we do have  knowledge of creative troubles with  respect to one of the postponed movies  This concerns blade starring mahershava  Ali who is to embody the iconic  character from the comic Universe  shooting was supposed to start next  month however the psalm Tariq decided to  quit his position as director in late  September and take on the role of the  Executive Producer instead given this  news it was only a matter of time before  the release date was officially pushed  back which has now actually been done  what many were not quite aware of though  is that this also messes up the entire  film schedule of the MCU and as a result  not only blade but also several other  films are affected by the postponement  blade is now due for release on  September 6 2024 causing Deadpool 3 to  be pushed back by two months on November  8  2024. we must also wait longer for the  Fantastic Four Adventure which won't be  released until February 14  2025. the last two movies affected  include an as yet unknown Marvel movie  that will be released on November 7th  2025 and Avengers Secret Wars which is  now slated for a May 1st 2026 release  date especially for Avengers fans the  postponement is anything but positive  since both sequels were originally  intended to be released within a short  time of each other in 2025. obviously  this is no longer going to happen as  there is now a year between the two  releases a bitter disappointment for  many MCU fans with such a finicky  scheduling of movies even small changes  have a big impact but at least we won't  have to spend a lot of time waiting for  the next MCU film after all the  theatrical release of the last phase 4  film black panther 2 wakanda forever is  already approaching on November 11th  last week Nintendo released the first  trailer for the upcoming Super Mario  Brothers movie of course the trailer has  made massive waves after all just about  anyone knows the famous Italian plumber  whether from the classic Nintendo  platformer days or from later spin-offs  like Mario Kart when the signing of  Jurassic world star Chris Pratt was  announced some time ago as the voice of  the always cheerful Mario the reactions  were rather positive in the trailer  however Pratt and his character get  little attention with fans instead  admiring the powerful performance of  Bowser voiced by Jack Black sadly  opinions on Pratt's performance are  rather negative finding little approval  among fans despite Pratt's Superstar  status the community misses Charles  martinet who unmistakably breathed life  into the plumber and also dubbed other  characters like Luigi Bowser and Donkey  Kong in addition Pratt speaks without an  Italian accent which certainly sounds  odd at first the second point of  criticism concerns the visuals of Mario  as he looks slightly different from what  many fans have not expected since the  trailer's release many suggestions for  improving the visuals have been  circulating especially on Reddit however  despite all the talk it has to be said  that the discussions surrounding the  Super Mario Brothers trailer are by no  means the equivalent of a shitstorm as  was the case but the first version of  Sonic if anything we are talking about  nitpicking here all in all the movie  adaptation looks visually appealing and  it will be interesting to see what other  promotional content we will get before  the release the Super Mario Brothers  movie is scheduled for release on April  7 2023  this week deadline announced new  information regarding the extremely well  cast The Expendables 4. for a long time  it was unclear when the film would be  released in movie theaters now we know  that a theatrical release is already in  sight on September 22nd 2023 with less  than a year to go in terms of plot The  Expendables 4 is once again about the  well-known mercenary team led by Barney  Ross this time they have to deal with a  current and volatile topic namely a  nuclear conflict between the United  States and Russia the film is sure to be  an action-packed spectacle like the  previous ones with an impressive cast  that fans of the genre can truly look  forward to the cast includes Sylvester  Stallone as Barney Ross Jason Statham as  Lee Christmas Dolph Lundgren as Gunner  Jensen and Randy Couture as toll road  other top stars appear in roles still  unknown including Curtis Jackson AKA 50  Cent and Transformer star Megan Fox for  Stallone this will be his last The  Expendables film in further releases  Jason Statham will assume the role of  the leader of The Expendables the story  was written by moonfall author Spencer  Cohen while Act of Valor director Scott  Waugh was in charge of directing  shooting was already concluded in  December of 2021. a first trailer has  also already been revealed at cinemacon  albeit out of the public eye The  Expendables 4 will hit U.S theaters on  September 22nd 2023 with release dates  in other countries sure to be announced  shortly  Arnold Schwarzenegger ensured that his  role as Conan the Barbarian achieved  worldwide Fame then there was Red Sonja  who also appeared heavily muscled and  fierce another movie about her has been  in the works since the 2000s and people  have been wondering who could possibly  replace Bridget Nielsen as a convincing  actress the answer is Matilda watts and  we actually got a first glimpse of her  character in the past few days apart  from the lead character and her sword  there is not much to see but the overall  impression is much more consistent  compared to the original from 1985. of  course since there are almost 40 years  between the two films a lot has been  done in the area of CGI and visual  effects and thus the trash factor is  totally missing in this picture instead  it gives off a more confident and  serious Vibe all in all a good choice  for a first teaser image that reveals a  certain prevailing mood without giving  away too much unfortunately the latter  also means that we are not able to guess  any details about the plot yet a release  date is still unknown but we will keep  you posted on further updates  now you are up to date with the latest  news from the world of movies and series  but of course we have even more to offer  you besides other amazing videos and  trailers you could watch the Super Mario  Brothers movie trailer if you haven't  done so yet and thus form your own  opinion on the matter wherever it takes  you next we wish you lots of fun  [Music]

